cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GM-Bench or its published results, please cite it as below."
title: "GM-Bench: a deterministic sports general-manager benchmark for LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  GM-Bench runs language-model agents as the general manager of a fictional
  hockey-style league over multiple simulated seasons, scoring roster, trade,
  free-agency, draft, and lineup decisions against deterministic scripted
  baselines under a frozen, fingerprinted benchmark contract.
type: software
authors:
